Generic single-database configuration for Alembic migrations.

This directory contains database migration scripts for the Vendor Service.

## Usage

Generate a new migration:
```bash
cd apps/vendor-service
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

Apply migrations:
```bash
cd apps/vendor-service
alembic upgrade head
```

Downgrade migrations:
```bash
cd apps/vendor-service
alembic downgrade -1
```

View migration history:
```bash
cd apps/vendor-service
alembic history
```

## TiDB Compatibility

These migrations are designed to work with TiDB (MySQL-compatible).
Avoid PostgreSQL-specific features like:
- ARRAY types
- JSON operators (use JSON functions instead)
- PostgreSQL-specific indexes
